	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d10r0201_swplazmam1_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>なかまが　くるまで　て
いつまで　なんだろうな？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-05T08:21:54" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-04T11:40:21" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>仲間が　来るまで　て
いつまで　なんだろうな？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-05T08:21:50" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-04T11:40:27" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・GRIDX＝60、GRIDZ＝17
・どちらに話しかけてもこのセリフから
　続けてswplazmam2_01
・プラズマフリゲート2回目クリアまで</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-05T08:33:43" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWPLAZMAM
プラズマ団♂・したっぱ１</Text>
